  "layout": "Left-to-right main data path: n_mem at far left, then n_dma, then two parallel unpack lanes n_unpackA (upper) and n_unpackB (lower) feeding n_srcA and n_srcB; n_srcA/n_srcB fan into g_fpu in the center, where n_alu and n_sfu sit as two parallel selectable paths; both converge on n_result, then n_packer, then back to n_dma and n_mem. g_engine encloses everything except n_mem. n_ctrl sits in a control corridor along the bottom of g_engine, with dashed control edges fanning up to n_dma, n_unpackA, n_unpackB, n_alu, n_sfu, n_packer; feedback edges from n_result and n_dma return along the bottom corridor. Reading order: memory -> DMA -> unpack -> source registers -> FPU -> result -> packer -> DMA -> memory, with control corridor read last.",
